{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年35歲的「最強小三」、「五索」鍾睿心，與身家百億計的大生銀行主席馬清鏗被踢爆父女戀後相當高調，五索時常在社交網站分享與馬清鏗以及四名子女的生活點滴。馬清鏗雖然一開始十分抗拒鏡頭，但隨住兩人戀情曝光時間愈來愈長，也不時露樣與女友拍片。近日五索與馬清鏗原來去了不丹旅行，更求當地喇嘛加持生活順利，更大騷腹肌！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260228/1104429800593821696019764.png/DdtyU8whKmzruz_pGykLN4ERv6qoQvYsZMwM5WTMDOU\" alt=\"現年35歲網紅鍾睿心Rachel 五索，率一眾子女和馬生慶祝生日。（IG）\"><figcaption>現年35歲網紅鍾睿心Rachel 五索，率一眾子女和馬生慶祝生日。（IG）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260324/1113198374213128192871630.jpeg/pywJfJALgTjH1S6gpmLm8CePQ8QMCxmC5WqO9uVqjvY\" alt=\"五索以幽默態度面對。(ig@5kidsokma)\"><figcaption>五索以幽默態度面對。(ig@5kidsokma)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260517/1132739274425634816278540.png/m35UTJKLZToHuVzA_w0Y8baqtkm-dw8f35gC8N-YAvA\" alt=\"馬生一秒怒睥五索。（IG@5kidsokma）\"><figcaption>馬生一秒怒睥五索。（IG@5kidsokma）</figcaption></figure><p>五索馬清鏗不丹求加持</p><p>五索日前在社交平台分享到不丹旅行的片段。五索先曬出在當地酒店拍下的腹肌，生了四個的她身材Fit爆，穿上黑色短衫，性感又健康。之後她又曬出窗外大自然優美景色，住得十分不錯。其後五索與馬清鏗到達寺廟，她坦言會接受喇嘛加持祝福：「一陣呢，喇嘛就會幫我加持啦！」</p><p>五索在寺廟中與喇嘛合照，她站在中間，跟住馬清鏗再行上前一起合照。五索又Post出與馬清鏗一起點燈祈願的片段。五索發文不忘多謝馬清鏗貼心安排：「10天不丹之旅結束 感謝馬先生細心安排 心靈富足」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133068895607853056305412.png/cZqomNzLdW1ynd-BqArtqTCUySlO95UAVM9P0FTPT9A\" alt=\"五索曬腹肌。（小紅書）\"><figcaption>五索曬腹肌。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133068943234699264915082.png/FLedJ0VDmra-66UHE3nYtDbKCKUUvH8LL50jdi-dI3Y\" alt=\"酒店外景色優美！（小紅書）\"><figcaption>酒店外景色優美！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133068940806066176704956.png/NrMn1HDxdFJ7c1UbbTbUZfnnpc8Q3wv2YyWViGMllYg\" alt=\"五索到不丹寺廟求喇嘛加持。（小紅書）\"><figcaption>五索到不丹寺廟求喇嘛加持。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133068938360655872089274.png/EIgEf85YRnAUblN1OPeVecRz13JBJ1PLZwWh-mcFofo\" alt=\"合十合照。（小紅書）\"><figcaption>合十合照。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133068935671975936406217.png/-QUTGSiWFlLVYzjYrqjpmb2WLDXWnzr2vIXc77yF3O8\" alt=\"馬生之後入鏡。（小紅書）\"><figcaption>馬生之後入鏡。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133068933201399808841065.png/-a1te1dLWgZKnZHYsWwll7PoDJDA3sV3J4-RTyePkU8\" alt=\"點燈祈福。（小紅書）\"><figcaption>點燈祈福。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251224/1080471225496506368631805.jpeg/Vs6Ej0PL7bHxSUbct-2jMkdb5HWSpHE6vZfgHL2X4Bw\" alt=\"五索準備搬家了。(影片截圖)\"><figcaption>五索準備搬家了。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251224/1080471230106308608631594.jpeg/ad6cA2juqEw5VnFq3DnPuFwsIAeKsJ4jNgIbpjYCG6Y\" alt=\"五索囡囡出鏡。(影片截圖)\"><figcaption>五索囡囡出鏡。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251224/1080471227853836288418735.jpeg/aNhubrkCWS_IyxVAAi1d8A5LIVoRiQsUSDdlDEg3ZQw\" alt=\"五索囡囡出鏡。(影片截圖)\"><figcaption>五索囡囡出鏡。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251224/1080474849492602880814937.jpeg/rGf9_t8s-cRelHX94YyYT4i6JDzY_BtQPTSNQT00jUE\" alt=\"五索名牌包包不放衣帽間。(影片截圖)\"><figcaption>五索名牌包包不放衣帽間。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251224/1080474852122562560854967.jpeg/0foweqk-U77C5txin5i8b4KtFb5zCuqDwuzNrsLsza4\" alt=\"五索名牌包包不放衣帽間。(影片截圖)\"><figcaption>五索名牌包包不放衣帽間。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251224/1080489196046520320821074.png/SvNloZNj5qQA8oFkNopu-xbAhDfHPVkwptlWwqbZVsI\" alt=\"裕美同五索。（IG影片截圖）\"><figcaption>裕美同五索。（IG影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-18T17:17:46.838728+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":654,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}